	\item (i) \textbf{KuaiRand-Pure}~\cite{gao2022kuairand}: This dataset is collected from the recommendation logs of Kuaishou, a short-video platform. It consists of 30 days of interaction logs from 2022-04-08 to 2022-05-08. We split the data as follows: 2022-04-08 to 2022-04-21 for training, 2022-04-22 to 2022-04-28 for validation, and 2022-04-29 to 2022-05-08 for testing. We take the attribute tab as the scenario context. Since the top four scenarios account for more than 96\% of the total data volume, we select the four largest scenarios, labeled from K1 to K4, arranged in descending order of data volume. 
