demonstrating the clear advantage of multi-scenario models in jointly modeling data from different scenarios. 
However, for relatively sparse data scenarios, the performance of models like ICAN and ADIN is worse than that of single-scenario models, 
as their optimization objectives are dominated by data-rich 
scenarios.
