\title{Fluid Volume Assignment for Flow-Based Biochips: State-of-the-Art and Research Challenges}

\author{Alexander Schneider, Jan Madsen and Paul Pop% <-this % stops a space
\thanks{P. Pop, and J. Madsen are with DTU Compute, Technical University of Denmark, 2800 Kongens Lyngby, Denmark (e-mail: paupo@dtu.dk). A. Schneider was with the same group when this work was done.}%
