{We next evaluate the relationship between temporal consistency and group performance with a linear regression, averaging observations by group:}

\begin{equation}
   \textrm{Collective Return} = \beta_0 + \beta_1 \cdot \textrm{Contribution Consistency} + \epsilon \, .
