\subsection{Joint Missingness}
With a high amount of missing values across a majority of attributes, it is expected that the magnitude of jointly missing values, $Q_{JMmag}$, will be high for most variable pairs. The deviation from expected joint missing may, hence, provide more valuable insights. 

