Although autonomous operations of robots are prevalent in many mission-critical applications, safety-critical applications involving robots often need teleoperation with human supervision. For example, robots used in medical surgery are usually teleoperated under the supervision of a trained physician~\cite{choi2018telesurgery}. As typically the users and/or the robots are mobile in these applications, the teleoperation is enabled by 5G wireless communications. 

