\label{sec:Kriging_ANN_metamodeling}

In this section, we introduce and discuss the proposed Kriging bootstrapped Artificial Neural Network metamodeling technique. First we briefly introduce traditional Kriging and Artificial Neural Network metamodeling and then discuss our proposed modifications. Our proposed kriging bootstrapped ANN metamodeling technique is shown in Fig. \ref{Fig:metamodel_Flow}. 


