\section{Generating Vision-context-aware Speech}
\label{sect_method}
Previous sections have concluded that vision-context-aligned expressive speech can help users better understand information from visuals. 
In this section, we introduce the V-CASS method, designed to generate speech that is semantically and emotionally aligned with visual context.\\

