%  BUG 位于分布式训练框架的架构当中. 例如在DeepSpeed #2499中，用户反馈在推理环节未配置优化器的情况下，DeepSpeed 第三阶段出现检查点加载失败的异常状况。从常规推理流程来看，优化器并非必要配置项，这一现象也引发开发者惊讶的评论 “This is extremely counter-intuitive”。在后续持续深入的讨论中，开发者们逐步确认该 BUG 根源在于库的架构设计缺陷。由于推理引擎与优化器存在不合理的强耦合关系，导致在推理场景下，即便无需优化操作，也必须完成优化器配置，这种架构层面的不合理性使得问题定位过程变得困难 。
\textbf{Low-Level Bugs in the Distributed Training and Inference Frameworks}: This challenge refers to low-level bugs rooted in the fundamental architectural design of distributed training and inference frameworks. 
For example, in DeepSpeed Issue \textit{\#2449}~\cite{deepspeed2449}, DeepSpeed Stage 3 failed to load checkpoints when no optimizer was configured during inference. From the perspective of conventional inference workflows, the optimizer is not a necessary configuration item, prompting developers to remark with surprise, \textit{“This is extremely counter-intuitive.”} Through subsequent in-depth and sustained discussions, developers gradually identified the root cause of this bug as a flaw in the library's architectural design. Due to the unreasonable strong coupling between the inference engine and the optimizer, even in inference scenarios where optimization operations are unnecessary, the optimizer must still be configured. This architectural irrationality significantly complicated the root cause identification process.


