To understand the reasons behind the substantial fixing efforts required for bugs in distributed training and inference frameworks, we follow previous work~\cite{wang2021exploratory,yang2025towards} and manually review PRs containing the top 20\% of patches, each exceeding 50 LOC in size. We identify three key challenges in bug fixing.


