\subsection{RQ4: Common Fixing Strategy}

% We discover that approximately 48\% of bug fixes involve no more than 10 LOC, suggesting they may be easier to automate. Motivated by this, we manually inspect these patches and identify several small-LOC fixing strategies with automation potential. 

We discover that 48\% of bug fixes involve no more than 10 LOC, suggesting simple modifications suffice. Through manual inspection of these patches, we identify several small-LOC fixing strategies that could potentially be automated.


% 条件判断优化
% https://github.com/deepspeedai/DeepSpeed/issues/3777 例如在DeepSpeed #3777中，开发者通过增加对训练参数中requires_grad标志的检查，避免了不必要的梯度内存分配。
\noindent\faWrench\ \textbf{Conditional Logic Optimization}: This strategy enhances programs’ capability to handle potential scenarios by optimizing conditional logic. For example, in DeepSpeed \textit{\#3777}~\cite{deepspeed3777}, developers introduced a check for the \texttt{requires\_grad} attribute in model parameters to avoid unnecessary gradient memory allocation.


% https://github.com/hpcaitech/ColossalAI/issues/4903
% 参数处理方式改进
% 这类修复策略通过向程序引入额外参数或增强对参数的处理，为开发人员提供更丰富的功能配置选项，使其能够更灵活地适配实际需求，从而有效解决BUG。例如在ColossalAI #4908中，开发者通过为目标函数增设额外的参数接收空间，使函数在保持原有参数声明的基础上，能够动态接纳未在函数定义中显式声明的扩展参数，增强了该函数的兼容性。
\noindent\faWrench\ \textbf{Parameter Handling Enhancement}: This type of strategy introduces additional parameters to the program or enhances parameter handling, providing developers with more comprehensive configuration options to adapt to actual requirements flexibly and effectively resolve issues. For example, in Colossal-AI Issue \textit{\#4903}~\cite{colossalai4903}, developers addressed a library update conflict by adding the \texttt{**kwargs} parameter to the \texttt{attention\_forward} function. This allowed the function to retain its original parameter structure while dynamically accepting undeclared keyword arguments, thus enhancing compatibility.


% API 使用变更
% https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/issues/437 例如在Megatron-LM #437中，开发者将对张量操作的API由view改为reshape，保证了在并行计算下张量的正确性
\noindent\faWrench\ \textbf{API Replacement}:
This strategy addresses issues arising from context-specific API limitations by replacing employed APIs with more suitable alternatives that maintain functionality. For example, in Megatron-LM \textit{\#437}~\cite{megatronlm437}, developers replaced the \texttt{view} API with \texttt{reshape} for tensor operations, 
a more robust API capable of handling non-contiguous tensors generated during \textit{Group Query Attention} operations, thereby ensuring tensor correctness in parallel computation.



% 配置调整.这类修复策略通过对程序配置参数进行调整，修正因配置偏差导致的功能异常问题
% https://github.com/hpcaitech/ColossalAI/issues/4027 例如在 ColossalAI #4027 中，代码默认将分布式环境下不同节点间的通信桶大小配置为 12T，这一过大的默认值对运行效率产生显著影响。开发者后续将其调整为 12MB，并支持根据运行时状态动态优化，有效提升系统性能。
\noindent\faWrench\ \textbf{Configuration Adjustment}: This type of strategy corrects functional anomalies caused by configuration deviations by adjusting the program's configuration parameters. For example, in Colossal-AI Issue \textit{\#4027}~\cite{colossalai4027}, the code defaultly configured the communication bucket size between distributed nodes as 12T, which significantly impacted runtime efficiency. Developers later adjusted it to 12MB with dynamic optimization based on runtime states. 

% 版本兼容性检查
% 这类策略通过增加对第三方库版本，或硬件设别的检查，提前预防因版本不适配导致的 BUG。
% https://github.com/hpcaitech/ColossalAI/issues/4829 例如在ColossalAI #4829中，开发者为了使库能够在不同pytorch版本下运行，增加了对torch版本的判断，不同版本的torch导入不同的包，保证程序能够运行。
\noindent\faWrench\ \textbf{Version Compatibility Handling}: This strategy proactively mitigates issues stemming from version disparities by incorporating checks for third-party library versions or hardware configurations. A notable example is found in Colossal-AI Issue \textit{\#4829}~\cite{colossalai4829}, where developers addressed PyTorch version incompatibilities by implementing a conditional version check. Specifically, they fixed the code to dynamically import compatible scheduler base classes: \texttt{\_LRScheduler} for PyTorch versions below 2.0 and \texttt{LRScheduler} for 2.0 and above, depending on the detected runtime environment. 

