As shown in the Table I and II, \gemini{} performed better than \gpt{} and \gemma{}, in both textual and speech language identification tasks, especially in African, Southern and Southeastern Asian languages. For text LID, the rankings of most challenging language groups to classify are: Africa \textgreater{} Southeastern Asia \textgreater{} Southern Asia \textgreater{} Americas/Oceania \textgreater{} Most European languages, while the Eastern, Western and Central Asian languages seems easy to be distinguished with nearly perfect accuracy. 



